{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20195","headline":"上昭成阁不得於从侄僧悟空院叹嗟 · 孟郊","name":"上昭成阁不得於从侄僧悟空院叹嗟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲上千级阁，问天三四言。\n未尽数十登，心目风浪翻。\n手手把惊魄，脚脚踏坠魂。\n却流至旧手，傍掣犹欲奔。\n老病但自悲，古蠹木万痕。\n老力安可夸，秋海萍一根。\n孤叟何所归，昼眼如黄昏。\n常恐失好步，入彼市井门。\n结僧爲亲情，策竹爲子孙。\n此诚徒切切，此意空存存。\n一寸地上语，高天何由闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}